    (uuid "2ef65aed-c41e-5011-8dc5-eec4d7b1994f"))
  (text "Supply boundary / power converters are in the power project"
    (at 20.32 32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (color 0 70 190 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bedab3b6-61d4-5813-a987-4911f2559510"))
  (text "SHEET GUIDE / 0010_EXTERNAL_SUPPLIES"
    (at 156.21 19.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) (color 86 96 108 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "908a7cf2-07cf-5e9d-8947-8ef013a412b7"))
  (text "External supplies and references"
    (at 156.21 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) bold (color 25 47 72 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "7e7da56a-f728-51de-b2fb-4f80e070069e"))
  (polyline (pts (xy 156.21 35.56) (xy 278.13 35.56)) (stroke (width 0.18) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "b954cdbc-65fe-58db-b0ce-de2370376642"))
  (text "Purpose and role" (at 156.21 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0306b043-b38a-5e5a-9523-9b5d23859f0a"))
  (text "These global nets receive supplies from the separate MIRA power\nproject. No DC/DC converters or power-manager MCU are included here."
    (at 156.21 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "99374e2f-1ee1-5478-ae40-939de26419f7"))
  (text "Inputs and outputs" (at 156.21 65.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "976fcf7d-b280-5d3f-89f6-fe32f762d20f"))
  (text "16 supply/reference nets and common GND are required. All PWR_FLAG\nsymbols are virtual markers of external power, not supply generators."
    (at 156.21 70.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "eb7d0adf-a0f2-515e-bb15-76ad11abb42d"))
  (text "Control logic" (at 156.21 90.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7268a517-9b33-579d-ba1c-e1b2faef146b"))
  (text "External power must follow the original startup and readiness\nsequence. AON remains the fault-interface supply; IO3V3 and SYS3V3\nserve different domains."
    (at 156.21 95.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "afab2428-6f60-5c9b-93d8-3606a122e248"))
  (text "Timing and settings" (at 156.21 115.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eded3f6a-e3f5-5f62-a5dd-731fe55cbef4"))
  (text "VTT and DDR_VREF nominally follow half DDR1V35. P15/N15 serve analogue\ncircuits; PROG_P15/PROG_N15 are separately switched forming supplies."
    (at 156.21 120.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "91652d68-2dae-52ff-80c8-588385f4ce07"))
  (text "Protection and fault response"
    (at 156.21 140.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f54fd3a5-0d1f-5429-a660-5ea5f0356156"))
  (text "Connect every supply return to the defined GND. Current budgets,\ninterboard connections and rail shutdown behavior must be reviewed\nbefore PCB layout."
    (at 156.21 145.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e3eb7532-cfd8-5492-989b-7da11aa9f150"))
